    "text": "Diseases our minds, our bodies destroys",
    "start": 2232.96,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "families",
    "start": 2237.52,
    "duration": 6.599
  },
  {
    "text": "and organizations and societies.",
    "start": 2239.04,
    "duration": 5.079
  },
  {
    "text": "And sometimes maybe it feels like the",
    "start": 2245.04,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "only option,",
    "start": 2248.079,
    "duration": 6.241
  },
  {
    "text": "the only option, no options. So we",
    "start": 2250.88,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "justify it. But it's never truly the",
    "start": 2254.32,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "only option. Anything hatred can do can",
    "start": 2256.88,
    "duration": 10.12
  },
  {
    "text": "be done better by something else.",
    "start": 2261.28,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And we don't have to relinquish our",
    "start": 2268.16,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "ethical commitments in order to",
    "start": 2270.72,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "release hatred. Feels like they're bound",
    "start": 2274.24,
    "duration": 6.599
  },
  {
    "text": "up, but it's not.",
    "start": 2277.119,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Non-hatred is not love. It's different",
    "start": 2282.24,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "than love. Love maybe is too much, too",
    "start": 2285.599,
    "duration": 6.321
  },
  {
    "text": "much to demand that we summon a feeling",
    "start": 2288.56,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "of warmth.",
    "start": 2291.92,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "But non-hatred, that's plenty.",
    "start": 2294.56,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "As I understand it, the uh the that",
    "start": 2299.04,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "famous line, the poly is is hatred does",
    "start": 2301.839,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "not cease through hatred, but through",
    "start": 2306.079,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "sometimes it's rendered as love, but",
    "start": 2308.8,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "apparently it's non-hatred. Hatred does",
    "start": 2311.2,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "not cease through hatred, but nonhat",
    "start": 2314.96,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "through non-hatred.",
    "start": 2318.32,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2322.0,
    "duration": 8.2
  },
  {
    "text": "that's enough. Non-hatred is enough.",
    "start": 2324.4,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "One of the",
    "start": 2330.8,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "appealing qualities about non-hatred",
    "start": 2333.28,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "public sphere is that the the",
    "start": 2336.48,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "juxiposition",
    "start": 2338.4,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "of hate with non-hate is",
    "start": 2340.16,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "very stark.",
    "start": 2344.16,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, when we're dwelling",
    "start": 2346.24,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "dwelling in hate, it's hard to tell just",
    "start": 2349.359,
    "duration": 9.121
  },
  {
    "text": "how horrific a mind state it is.",
    "start": 2353.68,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But when contrasted",
    "start": 2358.48,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "with um any softening",
    "start": 2361.68,
    "duration": 7.399
  },
  {
    "text": "so clear",
    "start": 2365.68,
    "duration": 3.399
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh a campaign, you know, simply",
    "start": 2371.119,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "advocating non-hatred",
    "start": 2376.24,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "doesn't have to take complex policy",
    "start": 2379.2,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "positions. It's not a utopian vision.",
    "start": 2382.48,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "simply highlights the corrosiveness of",
    "start": 2385.92,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "aid.",
    "start": 2389.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "So",
    "start": 2393.2,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "any uh PR campaign",
    "start": 2395.76,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "needs ambassadors, right? So who should",
    "start": 2399.2,
    "duration": 7.32
  },
  {
    "text": "spread the good word?",
    "start": 2402.8,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Well,",
    "start": 2406.8,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "phase two,",
    "start": 2410.72,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Michelle Obama, Steph Curry.",
    "start": 2412.96,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "That's what I have in mind. Phase one,",
    "start": 2416.8,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "for better or worse,",
    "start": 2420.8,
    "duration": 4.559
  },
  {
    "text": "it's us.",
    "start": 2423.599,
    "duration": 5.561
  },
  {
    "text": "You, me.",
    "start": 2425.359,
    "duration": 3.801
  },
  {
    "text": "When the",
    "start": 2430.16,
    "duration": 9.6
  },
  {
    "text": "the Buddha said, um, guard your senses,",
    "start": 2432.72,
    "duration": 10.399
  },
  {
    "text": "he's not joking.",
    "start": 2439.76,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Sounds restrictive.",
    "start": 2443.119,
    "duration": 6.281
  },
  {
    "text": "Guard your senses.",
    "start": 2445.52,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "It's another way of saying",
    "start": 2449.44,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "uh",
    "start": 2452.88,
    "duration": 5.479
  },
  {
    "text": "we're vulnerable.",
    "start": 2455.04,
    "duration": 3.319
  },
  {
    "text": "We need to",
    "start": 2459.599,
    "duration": 6.841
  },
  {
    "text": "protect our love.",
    "start": 2462.72,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And so study your",
    "start": 2468.319,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "intention, the movements of your mind,",
    "start": 2471.839,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "cultivation of hatred, non-hatred. study",
    "start": 2475.04,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "that",
    "start": 2478.64,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2481.28,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "vow vow to um express your care",
    "start": 2482.96,
    "duration": 9.76
  },
  {
    "text": "in uh",
    "start": 2489.2,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "as many interactions as you can.",
    "start": 2492.72,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "This is our",
    "start": 2496.24,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "quiet evangelism.",
    "start": 2498.24,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "SA member happened to uh send me this",
    "start": 2507.28,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "poem this morning. Couldn't uh pick out",
    "start": 2512.56,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "something more relevant.",
    "start": 2516.64,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "It's a William Stafford ritual to",
    "start": 2519.359,
    "duration": 9.161
  },
  {
    "text": "read to each other.",
    "start": 2524.16,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "If you don't know the kind of person I",
    "start": 2529.359,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "am and I don't know the kind of person",
    "start": 2532.24,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "you are,",
    "start": 2536.319,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "a pattern that others made",
    "start": 2538.16,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "may prevail in the world and following",
    "start": 2541.52,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "the wrong god home. We may miss our",
    "start": 2545.359,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "star.",
    "start": 2549.2,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "For there is many a small betrayal in",
    "start": 2552.0,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "the mind,",
    "start": 2555.28,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "a shrug that lets the fragile sequence",
    "start": 2556.96,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "break,",
    "start": 2560.079,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "sending with shouts the horrible errors",
    "start": 2561.599,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "of childhood",
    "start": 2565.2,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "storming out to play through the broken",
    "start": 2567.28,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "dyke.",
    "start": 2570.88,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And as elephants parade, holding each",
    "start": 2573.44,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "elephant's tail.",
    "start": 2576.16,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "But if one wanders, the circus won't",
    "start": 2578.48,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "find the park.",
    "start": 2582.96,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "I call it cruel and maybe the root of",
    "start": 2585.92,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "all cruelty",
    "start": 2589.359,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "to know what occurs but not recognize",
    "start": 2591.52,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "the fact.",
    "start": 2595.2,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And so I appeal to a voice to something",
    "start": 2598.079,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "shadowy,",
    "start": 2601.92,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "a remote important region in all who",
    "start": 2603.839,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "talk.",
    "start": 2608.64,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "Though we could fool each other, we",
    "start": 2611.119,
    "duration": 5.761
  },
  {
    "text": "should consider",
    "start": 2614.079,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "less the parade of our mutual life get",
    "start": 2616.88,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "lost in the dark.",
    "start": 2621.04,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "For it is important that awake people be",
    "start": 2624.0,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "awake",
    "start": 2628.64,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "or a breaking line may discourage them",
    "start": 2630.56,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "back to sleep.",
    "start": 2634.64,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "The signals we give",
    "start": 2637.04,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "yes or no or maybe",
    "start": 2640.16,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "should be clear.",
    "start": 2644.24,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "The darkness around us",
    "start": 2646.88,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "is deep.",
    "start": 2650.64,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Offer this your consideration.",
    "start": 2657.599,
    "duration": 4.76
  }
]